  "schema": "kit.sw2026.drawing-projection-occurrence-source.v1",
  "source_rules": [
    {
      "confidence": "confirmed-source",
      "rule": "The actual IView GetVisibleComponents dispatch fills its array through 42c0a140. The count/project step calls createComponentForReference(view, actual visible component, 1, 0); that factory combines the view reference chain and actual child component. concat installs the moChainComponent table for its ordinary valid-chain allocation branches."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "confirmed-source",
      "rule": "The IsRoot implementation returns false for the chain branch with unit predicate false, nonnull reference chain and nonnull resolved model. A model-root unit component is a different owner and is outside the drawing-projection predicate."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "confirmed-source",
      "rule": "GetParent asks getMoComponentInstance, which resolves an assembly configuration object from the filed owner. Missing config owner returns null. A drawing-owned chain has no assembly configuration object; its resolved child model is obtained through the separate nonroot +a8 route."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "confirmed-native",
      "rule": "Both packet04 pristine controls returned empty occurrence configuration and IsRoot=false while the view and actual child active configuration matched the explicit authored configuration. No GetParent, GetModelDoc2, edge enumeration or note creation had run before that failed predicate."
    }
  ],
  "unresolved": [
    "The exact native runtime class was not directly instrumented; the class assignment is static constructor evidence. The retry checks the observable ownership result without deriving IDs or shapes from the class hypothesis.",
    "GetParent and GetModelDoc2 predictions have not yet been measured by the edge lifecycle. They remain strict requirements in packet05.",
    "No note lifecycle or generated child downstream cache consumption has qualified."
  ],
